      "text": "src/inferencia/main.cpp\n(Chirale_TensorFLowLite directo)\n\nMicroMutableOpResolver<2>:\nFULLY_CONNECTED + SOFTMAX\n\nq = round(x / scale) + zero_point\nentrada->data.int8[0..2] = q\n\nInvoke()\n\np = (q - zero_point) · scale\n\nLED RGB del color detectado\n(apagado si < 80 %)",
      "originalText": "src/inferencia/main.cpp\n(Chirale_TensorFLowLite directo)\n\nMicroMutableOpResolver<2>:\nFULLY_CONNECTED + SOFTMAX\n\nq = round(x / scale) + zero_point\nentrada->data.int8[0..2] = q\n\nInvoke()\n\np = (q - zero_point) · scale\n\nLED RGB del color detectado\n(apagado si < 80 %)",
